WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900
First we start the shipboard server.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:09.475
The deploy pipeline is idle, five stages waiting.

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:18.350
One click ships it, and the stages go green in turn.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:23.400
The server logged every stage as it happened.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:31.825
And there it is, live in about two seconds.
